When it comes to gems I always think that touchstones are very
underrated.  If you've done the mines you may well have picked one up.
 It'll make a "scritch, scritch" sound if you rub a dagger (or
possibly any metal object, but I can't confirm that) on it.  If you
find one then bless it and you can identify any gem that you then #rub
onto it.

When it comes to potions I sometimes just drink the unidentified ones.
 As long as you stick to uncursed ones your chances of getting a bad
one are fairly low.  As long as you're somewhere fairly safe then it
should be ok.  And take your armour off in case you get polymorph!

